### API Root - Get API Info
GET http://localhost:5050/

###

## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
##  USER AUTHENTICATION
## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Register User
POST http://localhost:5050/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vaishnavi Reddy",
  "email": "vaishu@example.com",
  "password": "123!"
}

###

### Login User (Copy the token from response)
POST http://localhost:5050/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vaishu@example.com",
  "password": "123!"
}

###

## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
##  EVENT MANAGEMENT
## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Create Event (Protected)
POST http://localhost:5050/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tech Conference 2025",
  "description": "Annual technology conference with workshops and keynotes",
  "date": "2025-12-15T10:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-12-15T18:00:00Z",
  "location": "Convention Center, Downtown",
  "capacity": 500,
  "ticketTypes": {
    "General": { "price": 50, "available": 300 },
    "VIP": { "price": 150, "available": 150 },
    "EarlyBird": { "price": 30, "available": 50 }
  }
}

###

### Get All Events (Public)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/events

###

### Get Single Event (Public)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/events/1

###

### Update Event (Protected)
PUT http://localhost:5050/api/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 600,
  "status": "ongoing"
}

###

### Delete Event (Protected)
DELETE http://localhost:5050/api/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
##  TICKET BOOKING
## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Book Ticket (Protected)
POST http://localhost:5050/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "type": "VIP",
  "paymentMethod": "card"
}

###

### Get My Tickets (Protected)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/tickets/my-tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Cancel Ticket (Protected)
PUT http://localhost:5050/api/tickets/cancel/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
##  ATTENDEE MANAGEMENT & CHECK-IN
## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get Event Attendees (Protected)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/attendees/event/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Check-in Attendee by Ticket ID (Protected)
POST http://localhost:5050/api/attendees/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketId": 1
}

###

### Undo Check-in (Protected)
POST http://localhost:5050/api/attendees/undo-checkin/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Check-in Statistics (Protected)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/attendees/stats/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

