##  ANALYTICS & DASHBOARD
## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get Dashboard Analytics
GET http://localhost:5050/api/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Event Analytics (Protected)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/analytics/event/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Revenue Analytics (Protected)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/analytics/revenue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

